B.Na=s(["Issue creation with category, priority, and description","Assignment workflow for managers and team leads","Status tracking: Open \u2192 In Progress \u2192 Resolved","Comment threads on each issue for discussion","Dashboard with issue analytics and resolution metrics","Role-based access (Employee, Manager, Admin)","Email notifications on issue updates"],t.s)
